&lt;h1&gt;Buyer&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Position Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Buyer is responsible for supporting daily procurement activities by sourcing materials and services, processing purchase orders, coordinating with suppliers, and ensuring timely delivery to support business operations. This position focuses on procurement execution, supplier communication, and order management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Essential Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Procurement Execution&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process purchase requisitions and issue purchase orders in a timely manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obtain quotations from suppliers and support price comparisons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow established procurement policies and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accuracy of purchasing documents and system records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support contract and supplier documentation maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Supplier Management&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate with suppliers regarding pricing, delivery schedules, and order status.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow up on open orders and resolve delivery issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in identifying alternative suppliers when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain positive working relationships with suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Internal Customer Support&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Maintenance, Operations, Engineering, Facilities, and other departments to support purchasing needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clarify specifications and requirements with requestors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide procurement status updates to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Cost and Process Support&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cost-saving initiatives through quote comparisons and sourcing activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track market pricing and supplier performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with spend analysis and reporting as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve purchasing efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Compliance&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure purchasing activities comply with company policies and approval requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate procurement records and supporting documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support audit requests and reporting requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
