&lt;h3&gt;Education&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Associate&#39;s degree or Bachelor&#39;s degree preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equivalent combination of education and work experience will be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-3 years of purchasing, procurement, supply chain, administrative, or related experience preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manufacturing experience is a plus but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ERP systems is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and follow-up skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication and interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic negotiation and supplier communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office, especially Excel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
