&lt;p&gt;Gotion is seeking a dynamic Customer Quality Engineer that will be the quality interface between the customer and gotion, responsible for quality management and abnormal handling of battery cells, modules packs and containers at the customer end, ensuring rapid response to customer complaints and effective problem closure, and promoting continuous improvement within the company to enhance customer satisfaction and brand reputation.&lt;/p&gt;
