&lt;p&gt;• Experience scoping and closing project-based or solution sales (not purely transactional product sales)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong commercial skills: able to build proposals, structure pricing, and navigate procurement processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Comfortable operating from a showroom hub with regular travel across territory (~30–40%)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• U.S. work authorization required; must be able to work on-site in Manteno, IL as a home base&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Experience (Required)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Direct experience in one or more of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Capital equipment dealer or distribution sales — mobile power, generators, temporary power, HVAC, or industrial equipment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• EV charging equipment sales — hardware, through dealer or direct channel (fleet or commercial segment)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Fleet electrification solutions — charging infrastructure, fleet management systems, or commercial EV equipment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Project-based solution sales — scoped deployments with installation, commissioning, or service components&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience selling into or alongside fleet managers, facilities directors, procurement teams, or utility EV program administrators&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Familiarity with US government incentive programs applicable to fleet charging: IRA tax credits, NEVI, utility fleet rebates&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Existing dealer or distributor relationships in capital equipment, power, or EV segments in the Midwest, Southeast, or nationally&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience using CRM platforms (Salesforce, HubSpot) for pipeline management and reporting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Exposure to working with or for a Chinese-owned OEM operating in the US&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Mandarin Chinese proficiency is a plus but not required&lt;/p&gt;
