&lt;p&gt;The HVAC &amp;amp; Utilities Engineer/Supervisor is responsible for the operation, maintenance, and troubleshooting of industrial HVAC systems within a manufacturing facility. This role focuses on factory air conditioning, air handling units, dehumidification systems, and chilled water systems. The position is hands-on and equipment-focused, with future responsibility to lead a team of engineers and technicians.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate, maintain, and troubleshoot industrial HVAC systems, including:&lt;/li&gt;
