&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of HVAC system operation principles and equipment structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience performing routine maintenance and preventive maintenance on HVAC equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to troubleshoot and repair common HVAC equipment failures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in factory or industrial equipment operation and maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and understand HVAC and mechanical drawings.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
