&lt;p data-start=&quot;145&quot; data-end=&quot;213&quot;&gt;Develop, debug, and continuously optimize laser welding processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;214&quot; data-end=&quot;309&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;216&quot; data-end=&quot;309&quot;&gt;Define and maintain welding parameters such as power, speed, frequency, and focal position.&lt;/p&gt;
