&lt;li&gt;High School Diploma or GED required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in industrial maintenance experience in a manufacturing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting skills in mechanical, electrical, pneumatic, and hydraulic systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with 120V, 240V, and 480V industrial electrical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and interpret electrical, mechanical, pneumatic, and hydraulic schematics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using diagnostic equipment including multimeters, clamp meters, and test instruments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with hand tools, power tools, and precision measuring devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and prioritize multiple tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
