&lt;li&gt;Experience with industrial robots (FANUC, ABB, Yaskawa, KUKA, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forklift maintenance experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Welding and fabrication experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of CMMS systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OSHA 10 or OSHA 30 certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certified Maintenance &amp;amp; Reliability Technician (CMRT) or similar credential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
