&lt;li&gt;Support construction teams during installation, commissioning, startup, and project closeout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with electrical, civil, controls, facilities, and construction teams throughout project execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform engineering calculations for mechanical systems, equipment sizing, utility demand, and piping systems.&lt;/li&gt;
