&lt;p data-start=&quot;2576&quot; data-end=&quot;2672&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2576&quot; data-end=&quot;2602&quot;&gt;2+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in production planning, manufacturing operations, or a related role&lt;/p&gt;
