&lt;p data-start=&quot;3846&quot; data-end=&quot;3932&quot;&gt;Proficiency with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3863&quot; data-end=&quot;3875&quot;&gt;Power BI&lt;/strong&gt; or similar data visualization tools strongly preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3933&quot; data-end=&quot;4026&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3935&quot; data-end=&quot;4026&quot;&gt;Proven ability to identify process gaps and drive &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3985&quot; data-end=&quot;4024&quot;&gt;planning and execution improvements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4027&quot; data-end=&quot;4103&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4029&quot; data-end=&quot;4103&quot;&gt;Confidence communicating plans, risks, and recommendations to leadership&lt;/p&gt;
