&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The ideal candidate possesses strong technical knowledge of industrial electrical systems, utilities, mechanical infrastructure, and facility construction, along with exceptional leadership, project management, logistics coordination, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
