&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gotion is seeking an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Recruiting Manager (Bilingual Mandarin)&lt;/strong&gt; to lead our Talent Acquisition function during an exciting period of rapid growth. This role is responsible for developing and executing recruiting strategies while leading a team of recruiters supporting manufacturing, engineering, operations, finance, supply chain, and corporate functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Recruiting Manager will serve as a strategic business partner to both U.S. and China-based leadership, requiring the ability to communicate effectively in &lt;strong&gt;English and Mandarin&lt;/strong&gt; to support hiring initiatives, workforce planning, and cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Acquisition Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team of recruiters and recruiting coordinators to achieve hiring goals across multiple business functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish recruiting priorities, hiring strategies, and performance expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement within the Talent Acquisition organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Workforce Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with U.S. and China-based executives, HR leaders, and hiring managers to forecast workforce needs and develop strategic recruiting plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support organizational growth by aligning recruiting strategies with business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Cycle Recruitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee full-cycle recruiting for engineering, manufacturing, operations, finance, supply chain, IT, quality, and leadership positions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personally recruit for executive, highly technical, and confidential positions when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Sourcing &amp;amp; Pipeline Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop innovative sourcing strategies using LinkedIn Recruiter, networking, industry associations, universities, military recruiting, referrals, and passive candidate outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build long-term talent pipelines for critical and difficult-to-fill positions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiting Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
