&lt;li&gt;Time-to-Hire&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer Acceptance Rate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cost-per-Hire&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diversity Metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present recruiting performance and hiring forecasts to executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employer Branding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with HR and Marketing to strengthen Gotion&#39;s employer brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Gotion at universities, career fairs, professional organizations, and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure recruiting practices comply with federal, state, and local employment laws and company policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain consistent hiring documentation and process compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
