&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bilingual proficiency in English and Mandarin (speaking, reading, and writing) is required.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of progressive recruiting experience, including technical, manufacturing, engineering, and corporate recruiting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of recruiting leadership or Talent Acquisition management experience.&lt;/li&gt;
