&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;First Paragraph&quot;&gt;Gotion is seeking a highly motivated Senior Full Stack Software Engineer to join our Digitalization Team in Fremont, California.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;This position offers a unique opportunity to work at the intersection of software engineering,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;advanced manufacturing, and battery technology. You will help design and build next-generation digital platforms that support smart manufacturing, factory operations, enterprise productivity, industrial analytics, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;-driven applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
