&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Base pay is one part of our total compensation package at Gotion, and is determined within a range. This provides you with the opportunity to progress as you grow and advance your career at Gotion. The base pay range for this role is shown below, and will depend on your skills, qualifications, experiences, and location.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Expected Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Gotion Inc. is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We are dedicated to fostering a diverse workforce that reflects the communities we serve, cultivating a culture of inclusion and belonging, and ensuring equal employment opportunities for all.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We provide equal opportunity to all individuals regardless of race, creed, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, national origin, disability, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy or related conditions (including breastfeeding), parental status, criminal histories consistent with legal requirements, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Gotion Inc., we strive to create an environment where everyone feels valued, respected, and empowered to thrive.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gotion Inc. is based in Silicon Valley, CA, currently building a Manufacturing facility in Manteno, IL and has R&amp;amp;D centers in Ohio, China, Japan and Europe. We innovate in the next generation electric vehicle and energy storage technologies (lithium batteries and related systems) with the aim to accelerate electrified transportation and achieve sustainable development. Gotion is powered by a leading power battery technology company that provides solutions for vehicles including the world&#39;s first mass commercial e-bus route.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Gotion is a career destination - we are not simply attempting to just fill another job, but to pursue a dream of global green energy together! We offer outstanding opportunities to individuals seeking an exciting and challenging working environment. Everyone is highly valued and plays a vital role in the growth of our organization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;115i9ww&quot; data-start=&quot;149&quot; data-end=&quot;168&quot;&gt;Position Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;170&quot; data-end=&quot;621&quot;&gt;Gotion is seeking a highly motivated &lt;strong data-start=&quot;207&quot; data-end=&quot;230&quot;&gt;Structural Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to support the design, analysis, and execution of structural engineering projects for advanced battery manufacturing facilities, energy storage systems, and related industrial infrastructure. This role will be responsible for ensuring structural integrity, code compliance, and constructability across new construction, equipment foundations, facility modifications, and expansion projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;623&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate has experience designing steel and concrete structures within industrial, manufacturing, or large-scale commercial environments and enjoys collaborating with multidisciplinary engineering, construction, and operations teams throughout the project lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;902&quot; data-end=&quot;905&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1biysgw&quot; data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;947&quot;&gt;Essential Duties and Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;949&quot; data-end=&quot;2672&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xi5lm0&quot; data-start=&quot;949&quot; data-end=&quot;1099&quot;&gt;Design, analyze, and review structural systems for manufacturing facilities, laboratories, warehouses, office buildings, and utility infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1w8c6h6&quot; data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1269&quot;&gt;Perform structural calculations for steel, reinforced concrete, masonry, and foundation systems in accordance with applicable building codes and engineering standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bzn7gg&quot; data-start=&quot;1270&quot; data-end=&quot;1400&quot;&gt;Develop engineering drawings, specifications, reports, and calculation packages for new construction and facility modifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vsdj29&quot; data-start=&quot;1401&quot; data-end=&quot;1519&quot;&gt;Coordinate structural requirements with civil, architectural, mechanical, electrical, and process engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;n6qdpf&quot; data-start=&quot;1520&quot; data-end=&quot;1636&quot;&gt;Review vendor drawings, shop drawings, and contractor submittals to ensure compliance with project specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;h5mmby&quot; data-start=&quot;1637&quot; data-end=&quot;1778&quot;&gt;Support the design and installation of equipment foundations, mezzanines, platforms, pipe racks, supports, and other industrial structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gq8k05&quot; data-start=&quot;1779&quot; data-end=&quot;1894&quot;&gt;Conduct field inspections and site assessments to verify existing conditions and support construction activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;g23oq4&quot; data-start=&quot;1895&quot; data-end=&quot;2033&quot;&gt;Provide engineering support during construction, including responding to RFIs, reviewing field changes, and resolving structural issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17x8m1a&quot; data-start=&quot;2034&quot; data-end=&quot;2185&quot;&gt;Ensure projects comply with International Building Code (IBC), ASCE, AISC, ACI, OSHA, California Building Code (CBC), and other applicable standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2y2fda&quot; data-start=&quot;2186&quot; data-end=&quot;2278&quot;&gt;Collaborate with project managers to support scheduling, budgeting, and project execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1041xwj&quot; data-start=&quot;2279&quot; data-end=&quot;2374&quot;&gt;Assist in value engineering initiatives to improve constructability and reduce project costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9vknch&quot; data-start=&quot;2375&quot; data-end=&quot;2476&quot;&gt;Participate in root cause investigations related to structural deficiencies or construction issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xs0wir&quot; data-start=&quot;2477&quot; data-end=&quot;2579&quot;&gt;Maintain engineering documentation, calculations, and revision control throughout project execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3go7h4&quot; data-start=&quot;2580&quot; data-end=&quot;2672&quot;&gt;Support continuous improvement initiatives for engineering standards and design practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2674&quot; data-end=&quot;2677&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1fm6vrb&quot; data-start=&quot;2679&quot; data-end=&quot;2696&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;13hghqn&quot; data-start=&quot;2698&quot; data-end=&quot;2710&quot;&gt;Required&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2712&quot; data-end=&quot;3475&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;x2brjf&quot; data-start=&quot;2712&quot; data-end=&quot;2796&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Civil Engineering with an emphasis in Structural Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;186gdcn&quot; data-start=&quot;2797&quot; data-end=&quot;2845&quot;&gt;5+ years of structural engineering experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;zid4t7&quot; data-start=&quot;2846&quot; data-end=&quot;2950&quot;&gt;Experience designing industrial, manufacturing, semiconductor, energy, or large commercial facilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pm318o&quot; data-start=&quot;2951&quot; data-end=&quot;3059&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of structural steel, reinforced concrete, foundations, seismic design, and load analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lghqz0&quot; data-start=&quot;3060&quot; data-end=&quot;3167&quot;&gt;Proficiency with structural analysis software such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3116&quot; data-end=&quot;3154&quot;&gt;SAP2000, ETABS, RISA-3D, STAAD.Pro&lt;/strong&gt;, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
